<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 260 mln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 260 mln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction March 18 versus March 11 SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   179/186	  358/365</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.10/3.07	3.35/3.27</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.10/3.07	3.35/3.28</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.10/3.06	3.34/3.25</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million    90/670	  170/800</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    150/2,480	253/1,500</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 44,003 million markka, the STO said.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
